# TimeBank Project Context

TimeBank (时间银行) is a middle-school volunteer service recording system. Service hours → "time coins" (non-financial, never call them tokens/currency).

## Current State (2026-08-05)

**Backend (B0–B6 work items done, deployed, live on test server):**
- B0 Foundation, B1 Identity, B2 Base Data: `✅`
- B3–B5 all work items `✅`, phases `▶` on exit criteria (frontend demos, scale tests)
- B6 Hardening: most done; load test blocked on staging infra
- B7 Database Ops: mostly blocked on infrastructure
- B3F Cloud File Storage: not started (local-disk adapter in use)
- I1 backend: `FilterSpecifications` utility + filter/search wired across all list endpoints

**Frontend:**
- I0 `✅` — types lifted to `api/types.ts`, HTTP transport (`http.ts`), envelope/error handling, per-domain mock/real toggle, divergences fixed, dev-proxy recipe proven
- I1 `▶` (5/7 exit criteria met) — all 8 read domains swapped (18 methods, 10 screens), shared pagination infra (`usePagedApi`, `PageControls`, `ListStateBanner`), enum mapping layer. Two open: full bilingual re-audit, live `304` polling check
- I2 `▶` (all 8 domains wired, E2E verified) — all mutations (service records, reviews, accounts, projects, registrations, proposals, evidence upload, notifications, users, import/export, student profile) wired with real API calls, idempotency, versioning, error handling, and verified end-to-end against the real deployed backend.

## What Comes Next

**I3 Acceptance & Cutover** — evidence upload component (UI built from nothing), localization sweep (both languages), 12 E2E acceptance scenarios, historical import rehearsal, UAT with real users, production seeding, cutover plan

**Remaining I2 polish (can fold into I3):**
- Validation error → per-field display, conflict 409 → refresh UX, permission-aware affordances
- Rules UI redesign (backend's draft→publish lifecycle vs UI's in-place edit)

